    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 17th level, you can release a torrent of chaos flames at targets near you. You can use your action and expend 1 to 5 fel points, releasing a barrage of chaos flames at creatures of your choice within 30 feet of you. Each creature must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes [[/damage 1d8 fire]] damage and [[/damage 1d8 force]] damage for each fel point spend, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p>",
